      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}\n\nThe steps to reproduce this are very simple: it occurs when you are sitting in a “sit” zone that is moving at high speed.\n\nSince this is caused by synchronization with other players rather than local behavior, it is difficult to verify on your own.\n\nThis behavior occurs in version 1949.\n\nAfter running a few tests to prepare this reply, it appears that this is likely caused by a difference between the live version and the beta version—that is, a version mismatch with other users.",
