  "details": "This isn’t limited to flight-related features, but since it mainly occurs in those contexts, I’m writing it this way.\n\nI suspect that since this update, when a user’s coordinates change rapidly, synchronization lags, which is causing this issue.\n\nIf this continues, it will really ruin the atmosphere. I hope this gets fixed as soon as possible.",
